class Book {
private int pageNumber;
public void setPageNumber(int value) {
if (value > 0) {
pageNumber = value;
```

} else {

```java
System.out.println("Invalid value");
}
}
public int getPageNumber() {
return pageNumber;
}
}
public class BookApp {
public static void main(String[] args) {
Book book = new Book();
book.setPageNumber(100);
System.out.println(book.getPageNumber());
}
}
```

Sample Input: pageNumber = 100 Output: 100 The private field cannot be modified directly from BookApp; the value is set and retrieved through public methods.

